{
 "id": "seg2",
 "title": "先攻破人",
 "pill": 2,
 "total": 98.92,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg2-00",
   "text": "先给准确的说法。",
   "spoken": "先给准确的说法。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg2-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 1.28,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 2.665
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-01",
   "text": "社会工程，就是靠欺骗或利用信任，让人自己动手，做攻击者需要的事。",
   "spoken": "社会工程，就是靠欺骗或利用信任，让人自己动手，做攻击者需要的事。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg2-01.wav",
   "start": 3.1,
   "dur": 6.56,
   "speechStart": 3.1,
   "speechEnd": 9.493
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-02",
   "text": "内部人风险，是有合法权限的人，有意或无意地造成损失。",
   "spoken": "内部人风险，是有合法权限的人，有意或无意的造成损失。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg2-02.wav",
   "start": 9.88,
   "dur": 5.6,
   "speechStart": 9.974,
   "speechEnd": 15.244
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-03",
   "text": "最贵的漏洞，常常不在合约里，而在员工的电脑上。",
   "spoken": "最贵的漏洞，常常不在合约里，而在员工的电脑上。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg2-03.wav",
   "start": 15.7,
   "dur": 4.56,
   "speechStart": 15.7,
   "speechEnd": 20.089
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-04",
   "text": "攻击者不去破解多签合约，他让一个签名人，在自己电脑上打开一个文件。",
   "spoken": "攻击者不去破解多签合约，他让一个签名人，在自己电脑上打开一个文件。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg2-04.wav",
   "start": 20.48,
   "dur": 5.68,
   "speechStart": 20.571,
   "speechEnd": 25.92
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-05",
   "text": "之后，这台电脑上显示的一切，都可能是假的。",
   "spoken": "之后，这台电脑上显示的一切，都可能是假的。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg2-05.wav",
   "start": 26.38,
   "dur": 4.56,
   "speechStart": 26.38,
   "speechEnd": 30.738
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-06",
   "text": "打个比方，金库有三道门，三个人各管一把钥匙。",
   "spoken": "打个比方，金库有三道门，三个人各管一把钥匙。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg2-06.wav",
   "start": 31.16,
   "dur": 4.48,
   "speechStart": 31.253,
   "speechEnd": 35.432
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-07",
   "text": "窃贼不撬门，他给三个掌钥人，各寄了一封老同事的来信。",
   "spoken": "窃贼不撬门，他给三个掌钥人，各寄了一封老同事的来信。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg2-07.wav",
   "start": 35.86,
   "dur": 5.28,
   "speechStart": 35.86,
   "speechEnd": 40.921
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-08",
   "text": "信纸上涂了药，读过信的人，第二天会记错自己开的是哪道门。",
   "spoken": "信纸上涂了药，读过信的人，第二天会记错自己开的是哪道门。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg2-08.wav",
   "start": 41.36,
   "dur": 5.92,
   "speechStart": 41.36,
   "speechEnd": 47.053
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-09",
   "text": "比喻在这里不成立，真实的攻击者，不需要同时骗三个人。",
   "spoken": "比喻在这里不成立，真实的攻击者，不需要同时骗三个人。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg2-09.wav",
   "start": 47.5,
   "dur": 4.88,
   "speechStart": 47.597,
   "speechEnd": 52.236
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-10",
   "text": "签名人的电脑都运行同一个前端，攻破其中几台，再配合篡改前端，就可能凑够门槛。",
   "spoken": "签名人的电脑都运行同一个前端，攻破其中几台，再配合篡改前端，就可能凑够门槛。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg2-10.wav",
   "start": 52.6,
   "dur": 8.32,
   "speechStart": 52.6,
   "speechEnd": 60.69
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-11",
   "text": "攻击者能控制的，通常是这五样东西。",
   "spoken": "攻击者能控制的，通常是这五样东西。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg2-11.wav",
   "start": 61.14,
   "dur": 3.04,
   "speechStart": 61.14,
   "speechEnd": 64.015
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-12",
   "text": "一个假身份，冒充招聘者、前同事、合作方或者记者。",
   "spoken": "一个假身份，冒充招聘者、前同事、合作方或者记者。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg2-12.wav",
   "start": 64.4,
   "dur": 5.12,
   "speechStart": 64.493,
   "speechEnd": 69.295
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-13",
   "text": "一个任务，比如测试题、代码作业、一份复盘 PDF。",
   "spoken": "一个任务，比如测试题、代码作业、一份复盘 PDF。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg2-13.wav",
   "start": 69.74,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 69.74,
   "speechEnd": 74.569
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-14",
   "text": "一个会议，比如假会议软件，或者远程控制请求。",
   "spoken": "一个会议，比如假会议软件，或者远程控制请求。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg2-14.wav",
   "start": 75.0,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 75.0,
   "speechEnd": 79.564
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-15",
   "text": "一笔钱，用来收买客服或外包人员。",
   "spoken": "一笔钱，用来收买客服或外包人员。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg2-15.wav",
   "start": 80.02,
   "dur": 3.04,
   "speechStart": 80.02,
   "speechEnd": 82.811
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-16",
   "text": "还有一个被雇用的身份，冒名应聘远程岗位。",
   "spoken": "还有一个被雇用的身份，冒名应聘远程岗位。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg2-16.wav",
   "start": 83.28,
   "dur": 3.92,
   "speechStart": 83.28,
   "speechEnd": 86.97
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-17",
   "text": "公开通报显示，朝鲜相关组织在这类攻击中最活跃。",
   "spoken": "公开通报显示，朝鲜相关组织在这类攻击中最活跃。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg2-17.wav",
   "start": 87.42,
   "dur": 4.4,
   "speechStart": 87.513,
   "speechEnd": 91.64
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-18",
   "text": "但手法本身被各类犯罪团伙复用，防御不该只盯着一个组织。",
   "spoken": "但手法本身被各类犯罪团伙复用，防御不该只盯着一个组织。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg2-18.wav",
   "start": 92.04,
   "dur": 5.68,
   "speechStart": 92.133,
   "speechEnd": 97.488
  }
